      "mergeID": "61329c6e2bbefa7fd1984b07",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I use UDON sharp. OnAnimatorIK(int layerIndex){} method does not work.\nI looked at UdonBehaviour.cs, and I think the description of \" RunEvent(\"_onAnimatorIk\", (\"index\", layerIndex));\" in line 487 is wrong.\nThe correct value is \"_onAnimatorI \"K\"\", and I was able to confirm that it works in the Unity editor by changing the capital \"K\".",
